            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawuti'iimár waawutmo Yosia AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng ina báy, «Xáy aga aándi adoodá' múk Israeli kudá' inkihhimu wásl aa tleéhh? Ina geexayé' niri tsa/ané' gawaá umuúqo ságw tloomaro nee umuúqo dír gamuú xa'anoó loo/o naa/e as tsaatu'uuma ngiwa tleehhiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ngi xuu' tí sleémeero tleehharo birnga hhe'eesiyé' ni amor'eé' ki/iyá'. Ala naa baloó amor'eénií ki/i'iiká. Nee hhaeeín awa Yuda sleémeero ngaa ariyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yuda fuqtá múk Israeli kudá' inkihhimu wásl gana ga/aa/áy, inooínaadá' aníng naa sií'. Ala hhaeekaá lamuuse awa Yuda naa da'ayuti'iiká, nina tlayé' niri fuqtá ayé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsaatu'uuma dir'ine a gár ta hhasliitiiká, yaamu ngiri meetagaasiyé', tsaatu'uuma ngina tleehhiyé' tlaa/e nee xaai ngiwa haratlintati'iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe hhaeeín awa Yuda kudaá al/aymuuse naa amor'eénií ki/i'iiká ar muner'ín sleémeero, aqo har hhahhafiingw kilós. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
